  <text xml:lang="grc"><body xml:base="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.athamas_a_kai_b.dindorf1893-grc1"><div type="edition" n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.athamas_a_kai_b.dindorf1893-grc1" xml:lang="grc" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_athamas_a_kai_b"><head>ΑΘΑΜΑΣ Α. Β.</head><div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="1" xml:id="fragment-athamas_a_kai_b-dindorf1893_grc1-1" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_athamas_a_kai_b" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.athamas_a_kai_b.nauck1889grc1:1">
            <note type="source">Hesychius, Καταγνῶναι: ἐπιγνῶναι, μέμψασθαι. Σοφοκλῆς Ἀθάμαντι α΄.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="2" xml:id="fragment-athamas_a_kai_b-dindorf1893_grc1-2" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_athamas_a_kai_b">
            <note type="source">Scholia ad Aristophanis Nubium v. 257.</note>
            <quote>Ἀθάμαντα δὲ ἡ Νεφέλη δίκην αὑτῇ δώσειν διὰ τοὺς παῖδας πεποίηκε. προσαχθεὶς οὖν στεφανηφορῶν ἐν τῷ βωμῷ τοῦ Διὸς σφαγησόμενος, ὑπὸ Ἡρακλέους σέσωσται. οὕτω γὰρ Σοφοκλῆς ἐν δράματι πεποίηκε. (Conf. schol. Pindari Pyth. IV, 288. Apostolium XIII, 46.) Ἄλλως. ἐν Ἀθάμαντι Σοφοκλέους ὑπόκειται Ἀθάμας στεφανηφορῶν, ὥσπερ ἱερεῖον, δίκας εἰσπραττόμενος παρὰ Φρίξου. Ἄλλως. τοῦτο πρὸς τὸν ἕτερον Ἀθάμαντα Σοφοκλέους ἀποτεινόμενος λέγει. ὁ γάρ τοι Σοφοκλῆς πεποίηκε τὸν Ἀθάμαντα ἐστεφανωμένον καὶ παρεστῶτα τῷ βωμῷ τοῦ Διὸς σφαγιασθησόμενον. μέλλοντα δὲ ἀποσφάττεσθαι αὐτόν, παραγενόμενον Ἡρακλέα, καὶ τοῦ θανάτου ῥυόμενον, λέγοντα ὡς σώζοιτο ὁ Φρίξος, δι' ὃν ἔμελλεν ἐκεῖνος τεθνήξεσθαι.</quote>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="3" xml:id="fragment-athamas_a_kai_b-dindorf1893_grc1-3" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_athamas_a_kai_b" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.athamas_a_kai_b.nauck1889grc1:2">
            <note type="source">Hesychius, Ἕρκεσι: δικτύοις. Σοφοκλῆς Ἀθάμαντι β΄.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="4" xml:id="fragment-athamas_a_kai_b-dindorf1893_grc1-4" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_athamas_a_kai_b">
            <note type="source">Hesychius, Εψία: ὁμιλία. Σοφοκλῆς Ἀθάμαντι β΄.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="5" xml:id="fragment-athamas_a_kai_b-dindorf1893_grc1-5" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_athamas_a_kai_b" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.athamas_a_kai_b.nauck1889grc1:4">
            <note type="source">Chœroboscus p. 307, 14. ed. Gaisf. Ἀγύναιξ οἷον</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Ὡς ὢν ἄπαις τε κἀγύναιξ κἀνέστιος.</l>
            </lg>
            <note type="commentary">παρὰ Σοφοκλεῖ ἐν Ἀθάμαντι.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="6" xml:id="fragment-athamas_a_kai_b-dindorf1893_grc1-6" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_athamas_a_kai_b" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.athamas_a_kai_b.nauck1889grc1:6">
            <note type="source">Hesychius, Ἀγχήρης: ὁ ἐγγύς. Σοφοκλῆς Ἀθάμαντι.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="7" xml:id="fragment-athamas_a_kai_b-dindorf1893_grc1-7" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_athamas_a_kai_b" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.athamas_a_kai_b.nauck1889grc1:7">
            <note type="source">Harpocratio in Ἔπιπλον, τὰ κατὰ τὴν οἰκίαν σκεύη ἔπιπλα λέγουσι — Σοφοκλῆς Ἀθάμαντι.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="8" xml:id="fragment-athamas_a_kai_b-dindorf1893_grc1-8" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_athamas_a_kai_b" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.athamas_a_kai_b.nauck1889grc1:8">
            <note type="source">Hesychius, Ἐπιστήγματα: ἐπικελεύματα. Σοφοκλῆς Ἀθάμαντι.</note>
            <note type="commentary">ubi Ruhnkenius apud Valckenarium ad Theocriti VI, 29. ἐπισίγματα corrigit.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="9" xml:id="fragment-athamas_a_kai_b-dindorf1893_grc1-9" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_athamas_a_kai_b" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.athamas_a_kai_b.nauck1889grc1:9">
            <note type="source">Hesychius, Ἐχρωματίσθη: συνεχρώσθη. Σοφοκλῆς Ἀθάμαντι.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="10" xml:id="fragment-athamas_a_kai_b-dindorf1893_grc1-10" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_athamas_a_kai_b" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.athamas_a_kai_b.nauck1889grc1:5">
            <note type="source">Antiatticista Bekkeri p. 106, 33. Λευκὴν ἡμέραν: τὴν ἀγαθήν. Σοφοκλῆς Ἀθάμαντι.</note>
            <note type="commentary">De Hesychii loco βρυαζούσης λεαίνης vide ad Æschyli fragm. 4.</note>
          </div>
        </div></body></text></TEI>
